   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Small Arms Survey 2025. Through increased knowledge about the production, transfer, stockpiling, use and causes of proliferation of small arms and light weapons, the activities contribute to providing states, organisations and civil society with the basis and tools to produce relevant policy documents.uncontrolled proliferation of small arms and light weapons.</narrative>
